  "revision": {
    "2026-11-21": "The Roman identity (briefs 21-25), recorded from frontend/src/index.css as shipped: Cinzel 600/700 for the wordmark, fixed page titles and section titles only (capFont); Alegreya Sans 400/500/700/800 for everything else, with lining figures and a 0.5 size adjust; a porphyry shell (nav_band), vexillum red for the one filled action (action_fill), the selected state, links and a control in use; gold for lines and ornament only (gold), bronze for prices and small words (gold_ink); the niche fill; travertine and marble neutrals. Radii 6px (controls, cards, panels) and 4px (segments), stone-cut; ROUND_FOUR is the nearest enum. Shadows tinted with porphyry. The dark values are in index.css under :root[data-theme=\"dark\"]. carpathian-clear.json stays as history."
